@startuml 12-block-states
!include theme-oriolrius.puml
title KRL page: state of a block on each host
state "Rolling out\n(new list not yet served to this host)" as ro <<warn>>
state "Enforced\n(served to the host's puller)" as en <<good>>
state "Clearing\n(unblock not yet served)" as cl <<warn>>
state "Not enforced\n(no usable ECDSA key registration)" as ne <<bad>>
[*] --> ro : Block user
ro --> en : host pulls the new list
en --> cl : Unblock
cl --> [*] : host pulls the new list
note bottom of ro
  A host without krl-client never pulls:
  it stays at "Rolling out" and the block never lands.
end note
@enduml
